WEBVTT

01:40.180 --> 01:44.800
=Love Story in the 1970s=

01:45.322 --> 01:47.960
=Episode 28=

01:50.893 --> 01:53.190
Anyone who hasn't been through
the kind of pain you have

01:53.640 --> 01:54.720
doesn't have the right

01:55.000 --> 01:56.119
to judge your choices.

02:04.180 --> 02:05.182
Since I was little,

02:05.800 --> 02:06.800
my mom told me

02:06.800 --> 02:08.719
the most important thing in life
was a career.

02:10.320 --> 02:11.439
That's what she said,

02:12.040 --> 02:13.159
and that's how she lived.

02:14.760 --> 02:16.200
But now I realize

02:16.582 --> 02:17.620
that in her heart,

02:17.620 --> 02:19.715
her career was never
the most important thing.

02:19.960 --> 02:21.240
It was always her family.

02:27.960 --> 02:28.999
Maybe

02:29.960 --> 02:31.723
even she didn't realize that herself.

02:33.040 --> 02:35.272
Until you go through setbacks,

02:35.640 --> 02:36.647
you don't really know

02:36.719 --> 02:38.399
what matters most.

02:40.839 --> 02:41.999
Just like us.

02:45.660 --> 02:47.347
We didn't come together

02:47.448 --> 02:48.648
because we were in love.

02:52.399 --> 02:54.599
But that doesn't stop us

02:55.599 --> 02:57.697
from loving each other deeply now.

02:59.885 --> 03:00.484
Right?

03:06.360 --> 03:06.985
So...

03:08.040 --> 03:09.599
give your mom a little more time.

03:10.240 --> 03:11.485
Give yourself some time.

03:25.119 --> 03:26.240
Looking back,

03:27.760 --> 03:29.200
you've seen me

03:29.760 --> 03:30.719
at my worst.

03:32.399 --> 03:33.800
Because we are husband and wife.

03:37.640 --> 03:40.200
You don't have to pretend to be strong
in front of me.

03:41.839 --> 03:42.640
Not before,

03:44.040 --> 03:44.999
not ever.

03:58.097 --> 04:00.200
(Mathematics Department Teaching Office)

04:00.200 --> 04:01.240
Everyone,

04:01.260 --> 04:03.560
(Educators must first be educated.)
I'm honored to announce

04:03.604 --> 04:04.893
some good news today.

04:05.399 --> 04:07.159
Ms. Mu Shanhe's paper

04:07.719 --> 04:10.360
will be published
in the latest issue of China Science.

04:14.200 --> 04:14.920
Congratulations.

04:15.119 --> 04:15.399
Come.

04:15.439 --> 04:16.080
Congrats.

04:17.719 --> 04:18.200
Alright.

04:18.320 --> 04:19.000
Back to work.

04:21.599 --> 04:22.320
Mujing,

04:23.182 --> 04:24.293
come here for a moment.

04:27.520 --> 04:28.399
Professor Wu.

04:28.448 --> 04:30.248
You haven't been in great shape,
have you?

04:31.039 --> 04:31.680
No, I'm fine.

04:32.440 --> 04:33.880
I've known you for years.

04:34.120 --> 04:35.479
You've never made

04:35.604 --> 04:37.170
such a basic calculation mistake before.

04:41.960 --> 04:42.599
I'm sorry.

04:43.640 --> 04:44.315
It's alright.

04:44.448 --> 04:45.737
But your result

04:45.782 --> 04:48.440
is the foundation for
your entire group's follow-up research.

04:48.960 --> 04:50.479
Revise it together.

04:50.582 --> 04:52.060
That won't be necessary, Professor Wu.

04:52.200 --> 04:53.320
I'll take full responsibility

04:53.320 --> 04:54.648
for correcting the results myself.

04:54.719 --> 04:56.399
I don't want to burden everyone else.

04:56.839 --> 04:59.000
How can you manage
all that on your own?

04:59.000 --> 04:59.520
I can.

04:59.880 --> 05:00.479
Trust me.

05:07.200 --> 05:07.719
Yang,

05:08.399 --> 05:08.839
come.

05:25.804 --> 05:26.893
What are you looking for?

05:34.200 --> 05:35.080
Stop laughing.

05:35.239 --> 05:36.599
It's summer.

05:36.880 --> 05:38.000
Why are you wearing a scarf?

05:38.440 --> 05:39.359
Look at this.

05:44.039 --> 05:45.159
If I go to work like this

05:45.479 --> 05:47.320
and people see it, it's embarrassing.

05:48.039 --> 05:49.239
But wearing a scarf

05:49.599 --> 05:52.560
in this heat just draws
more attention, doesn't it?

05:54.640 --> 05:55.599
Then what should I do?

06:15.648 --> 06:17.293
Vice Director, you wanted to see me?

06:18.839 --> 06:19.440
Xia,

06:19.599 --> 06:20.560
what happened?

06:21.599 --> 06:22.560
This is outrageous.

06:23.120 --> 06:24.239
It's a new society.

06:24.640 --> 06:25.960
How dare he lay hands on her?

06:26.440 --> 06:27.279
You were hit?

06:28.520 --> 06:29.320
Comrade Xie Xiaoxia,

06:29.799 --> 06:30.279
well,

06:30.680 --> 06:31.320
don't be afraid.

06:31.760 --> 06:32.719
After work tonight,

06:33.000 --> 06:34.515
I'll represent the factory office

06:34.560 --> 06:35.760
and visit your home

06:36.039 --> 06:37.080
to speak with your husband.

06:37.599 --> 06:39.159
This involves intentional injury.

06:39.520 --> 06:40.799
We'll report it to the police

06:41.159 --> 06:42.159
and let them decide

06:42.271 --> 06:43.260
how it should be handled.

06:43.359 --> 06:43.839
Exactly.

06:44.039 --> 06:44.640
Don't worry.

06:45.039 --> 06:46.680
We won't allow the female worker

06:47.039 --> 06:48.640
to be harmed for no reason.

06:50.320 --> 06:50.760
Chief Wang,

06:51.399 --> 06:52.599
the Publicity Department

06:52.599 --> 06:53.919
should publish a few articles

06:54.200 --> 06:56.359
to call on all the female workers.

06:56.839 --> 06:57.919
If anyone suffers

06:58.200 --> 06:59.479
domestic violence,

06:59.839 --> 07:01.599
report it to the factory office.

07:02.159 --> 07:04.640
The factory office will be their family.

07:05.000 --> 07:06.479
We will stand up for them.

07:07.385 --> 07:08.517
Vice Director Chen,

07:08.760 --> 07:09.640
I'm worried

07:09.640 --> 07:10.560
some female workers

07:10.560 --> 07:11.760
would rather swallow their pain

07:12.440 --> 07:14.320
than let family matters become public.

07:14.680 --> 07:16.239
That's true, Vice Director Chen.

07:16.399 --> 07:17.520
Xie Xiaoxia

07:17.839 --> 07:19.640
never mentioned any of this before.

07:20.359 --> 07:22.440
We often saw her wearing
medicated patches,

07:22.826 --> 07:24.360
and she told us it was for the cold.

07:25.120 --> 07:26.520
If today's injury on her face

07:26.520 --> 07:27.760
hadn't been impossible to hide,

07:28.320 --> 07:29.320
I wouldn't have noticed.

07:34.799 --> 07:35.159
Alright.

07:35.680 --> 07:36.359
Chief Wang,

07:36.919 --> 07:39.279
notify all workshop directors

07:39.839 --> 07:42.399
and have them check in one by one

07:42.537 --> 07:43.915
with every female worker.

07:44.320 --> 07:45.826
If there are any unusual situations,

07:46.159 --> 07:47.200
do home visits one by one.

07:47.399 --> 07:47.919
Okay.

07:49.640 --> 07:50.719
Let's go.

07:50.830 --> 07:52.137
We're leaving, Vice Director.

07:52.640 --> 07:53.039
Come.

07:59.520 --> 08:00.159
Vice Director,

08:01.399 --> 08:02.640
I now seriously suspect

08:03.239 --> 08:05.320
that Comrade Fei Ni's husband,
Fang Muyang,

08:05.537 --> 08:07.315
may also be engaging
in violent behavior.

08:08.960 --> 08:10.919
I saw Fei Ni wearing a medicated patch

08:10.919 --> 08:12.000
earlier today.

08:12.572 --> 08:14.585
And she hasn't used
the factory bathhouse

08:14.799 --> 08:16.719
in a long time.

08:17.839 --> 08:19.039
But I heard

08:19.159 --> 08:20.880
her relationship with her husband

08:20.880 --> 08:22.159
is quite good.

08:23.239 --> 08:25.320
Many women care about their pride

08:25.960 --> 08:27.039
and don't dare speak out.

08:28.547 --> 08:29.187
Vice Director,

08:29.799 --> 08:31.197
for protecting Fei Ni,

08:31.399 --> 08:32.560
could I visit

08:32.560 --> 08:33.599
their home

08:34.759 --> 08:35.639
and look into it?

08:36.671 --> 08:38.800
I was the one who
uncovered Xie Xiaoxia's situation.

08:39.239 --> 08:40.680
I have some experience.

08:41.359 --> 08:42.040
If Fang Muyang

08:42.040 --> 08:43.440
leaves any clues,

08:43.648 --> 08:44.982
I'll be able to spot them.

08:45.479 --> 08:47.119
Then I can ask you to step in

08:47.247 --> 08:48.887
and stand up for Fei Ni.

08:52.800 --> 08:53.320
Alright.

08:54.119 --> 08:54.639
Go ahead.

08:55.920 --> 08:56.400
But

08:56.999 --> 08:58.239
before anything is confirmed,

08:59.048 --> 09:00.782
don't spread rumors or make a scene.

09:01.226 --> 09:02.230
Understood, Vice Director.

09:07.040 --> 09:08.680
How was it, Fei Ni?

09:09.288 --> 09:11.600
The suggestion I gave you
was pretty good, right?

09:12.840 --> 09:13.720
It's all your fault.

09:14.040 --> 09:16.133
People kept staring at me
in the factory all day.

09:16.239 --> 09:18.080
Feng Lin looked at me so strangely.

09:18.239 --> 09:19.560
She probably thinks you hit me.

09:21.159 --> 09:22.920
You could just say
your husband kissed you.

09:24.279 --> 09:25.080
Have some shame.

09:28.040 --> 09:29.359
I'll let you slide this time.

09:29.920 --> 09:30.920
Do me a favor.

09:31.399 --> 09:31.920
Name it.

09:32.440 --> 09:33.666
The male lead in my novel

09:33.800 --> 09:35.920
is about to return to the city

09:35.920 --> 09:38.159
and get assigned
to a Western restaurant.

09:39.840 --> 09:41.040
Isn't that me?

09:41.879 --> 09:42.239
Exactly.

09:43.200 --> 09:44.519
I'm in your drawing,

09:44.759 --> 09:46.119
and you're in my novel.

09:46.320 --> 09:48.320
That's a perfect complement
to each other.

09:49.560 --> 09:51.359
Can you tell me

09:51.479 --> 09:53.600
some interesting stories
about the restaurant?

09:53.840 --> 09:55.159
I need material.

09:55.479 --> 09:56.359
That's easy.

09:57.040 --> 09:58.119
I have a coworker.

09:58.840 --> 10:00.520
Everyone calls her Ms. Xu.

10:02.320 --> 10:03.119
Ms. Xu?

10:03.119 --> 10:04.359
She's from Sichuan,

10:04.679 --> 10:06.320
so she has a strong accent.

10:06.919 --> 10:07.800
I heard

10:07.800 --> 10:10.022
that just to communicate better
with everyone,

10:10.133 --> 10:12.577
she studies Mandarin
with her coworkers during the day

10:12.711 --> 10:14.310
and stays up at night learning English.

10:14.560 --> 10:16.359
How's her progress?

10:16.639 --> 10:17.280
Let me show you.

10:18.760 --> 10:19.439
Madam.

10:20.840 --> 10:23.080
These are Italian noodles.

10:23.959 --> 10:24.560
Sir.

10:24.760 --> 10:25.560
Eat what?

10:25.630 --> 10:27.733
Even though she speaks English
with a Sichuan accent,

10:27.740 --> 10:29.450
she can communicate
with foreign customers.

10:29.488 --> 10:30.710
That's impressive.

10:32.639 --> 10:33.520
Do you remember

10:33.520 --> 10:34.840
our manager, Peng?

10:34.840 --> 10:35.760
Your service

10:36.280 --> 10:37.760
must be elegant.

10:38.760 --> 10:39.399
And you,

10:39.560 --> 10:40.600
when you see a customer,

10:41.119 --> 10:42.280
smile.

10:42.840 --> 10:44.199
I don't think

10:44.560 --> 10:46.669
being strict

10:46.670 --> 10:48.066
is a problem.

10:48.100 --> 10:49.760
The problem is, he was strict
with others

10:49.800 --> 10:51.000
but was always thinking about

10:51.000 --> 10:52.933
how to take advantage
of the restaurant himself.

10:53.022 --> 10:55.080
Whenever he cleaned the bar counter,

10:55.222 --> 10:56.950
(he'd wipe the counter with one hand)

10:56.950 --> 11:00.439
(while slipping bread into
his pocket with the other.)

11:00.679 --> 11:01.840
Then he'd switch hands

11:02.840 --> 11:04.080
to wipe the counter

11:04.119 --> 11:06.280
(and sneak sugar cubes into his pocket.)

11:06.320 --> 11:07.560
Switched again

11:09.040 --> 11:11.879
and poured coffee beans into his pocket
and took them home.

11:12.159 --> 11:13.320
That's stealing.

11:13.320 --> 11:14.919
That's why he got caught later.

11:15.560 --> 11:17.000
We've got a new manager,

11:17.040 --> 11:17.760
Luo.

11:18.159 --> 11:20.639
He's the stingiest person
I've ever met in my life.

11:20.959 --> 11:21.520
Either

11:21.520 --> 11:23.399
he complains
that we use too much ketchup.

11:23.511 --> 11:25.222
Why are you pouring so much ketchup?

11:25.311 --> 11:27.350
If it's not enough,
the customer will ask for more.

11:27.422 --> 11:29.888
If they don't finish it,
that's wasting national resources.

11:29.911 --> 11:32.560
Or he complains that the fries
are cut too thick.

11:32.719 --> 11:34.840
Fries this thick? Did you
cut them to match your size?

11:35.010 --> 11:37.040
If the customer can't finish them,
that's a waste.

11:37.040 --> 11:38.959
Or he says
the steak portions are too big.

11:40.919 --> 11:41.399
Too big.

11:42.040 --> 11:43.879
Basically, he only has one line.

11:44.679 --> 11:45.679
What a waste.

11:46.159 --> 11:47.320
So wasteful.

12:18.020 --> 12:18.890
Lin Mei, you're finally here.

12:18.899 --> 12:19.580
What happened?

12:20.460 --> 12:20.929
Mom, Dad.

12:20.930 --> 12:22.548
That darn Wang Tengda is to blame.

12:22.560 --> 12:25.300
He got your brother to secretly
take on private driving jobs at night.

12:25.348 --> 12:26.860
He isn't that experienced at driving,

12:26.890 --> 12:28.580
and he got into an accident
late at night.

12:28.593 --> 12:29.437
He broke his leg.

12:29.580 --> 12:30.615
What did the doctor say?

12:30.860 --> 12:31.819
The doctor says

12:31.819 --> 12:33.899
he needs to stay in bed
for at least three months.

12:34.179 --> 12:35.939
And even when it heals,

12:35.939 --> 12:36.980
he'll probably limp.

12:37.340 --> 12:38.460
Can he still drive?

12:38.580 --> 12:40.620
How could he drive
after something like this?

12:41.179 --> 12:43.139
The transport team already
issued a notice.

12:43.139 --> 12:44.580
He's been fired.

12:44.580 --> 12:46.460
What's he going to do
for the rest of his life?

12:46.948 --> 12:48.126
What am I going to do?

12:48.899 --> 12:49.700
What can I do?

12:50.700 --> 12:51.139
You.

12:51.700 --> 12:52.139
You.

12:52.580 --> 12:53.980
You all have to provide for me now!

12:55.659 --> 12:57.779
Why do you think
I went out driving at night?

12:57.971 --> 12:59.860
Wasn't it to earn more money
to pay you back?

12:59.860 --> 13:00.860
Keep your voice down.

13:07.500 --> 13:09.100
We'll talk about that later.

13:18.460 --> 13:19.299
Lin Mei,

13:19.939 --> 13:20.899
look.

13:20.899 --> 13:21.980
Right now,

13:21.980 --> 13:24.299
Mom and Dad have to stay home
to take care of Jianshe.

13:25.179 --> 13:27.580
I can't take too many days off work.

13:27.700 --> 13:30.304
I have to look after your brother
and work at the same time.

13:31.100 --> 13:33.620
Isn't Fei Ting working in the canteen?

13:33.899 --> 13:35.580
The factory isn't far from here.

13:35.740 --> 13:36.580
Could he bring us

13:36.580 --> 13:38.179
some food?

13:50.580 --> 13:52.539
Didn't you hear her talking to you?

13:53.015 --> 13:54.260
You don't want to send food?

13:54.637 --> 13:56.571
Perfect, I didn't want to eat it anyway.

13:59.899 --> 14:00.539
Good.

14:00.815 --> 14:02.682
We don't have time to send it anyway.

14:02.939 --> 14:05.059
You want us to provide for you?
Aren't you ashamed?

14:05.059 --> 14:06.580
What do you mean you went out driving

14:06.580 --> 14:07.980
to pay Mom and Dad back?

14:08.179 --> 14:09.340
You stole the money.

14:09.340 --> 14:10.179
Say that again!

14:10.860 --> 14:12.340
Aihong, look at his temper.

14:12.340 --> 14:13.139
I can't bear it.

14:13.139 --> 14:13.939
He is yours.

14:13.939 --> 14:14.740
Lin Mei.

14:14.740 --> 14:15.539
He's just stubborn.

14:15.539 --> 14:16.340
Don't argue with him.

14:16.340 --> 14:17.171
Don't hold her back.

14:17.220 --> 14:17.939
Let her go!

14:17.939 --> 14:18.700
Get lost!

14:18.700 --> 14:19.380
Bye, Dad, Mom.

14:20.380 --> 14:20.939
Lin Mei.

14:21.460 --> 14:22.100
Lin Mei!

14:22.100 --> 14:23.340
Dad, Mom, we're leaving.

14:23.580 --> 14:24.620
Fei Ting, please.

14:24.620 --> 14:25.700
We're leaving, Aihong.

14:27.980 --> 14:29.059
You!

14:31.939 --> 14:33.139
Why were you yelling?

14:34.126 --> 14:35.340
You've driven Lin Mei away.

14:35.340 --> 14:37.059
All this will fall on me in the end.

14:37.340 --> 14:38.299
So what?

14:38.779 --> 14:39.860
You're my wife.

14:40.539 --> 14:42.100
If you don't take care of me, who will?

14:42.299 --> 14:43.380
I can't.

14:43.580 --> 14:44.700
You'll starve to death.

14:45.500 --> 14:46.059
Go!

14:46.059 --> 14:46.860
All of you, go!

14:47.899 --> 14:49.460
Stop it, will you?

14:49.779 --> 14:51.860
You shouldn't have yelled!

14:51.939 --> 14:52.939
Enough.

14:52.939 --> 14:53.460
You!

14:54.019 --> 14:55.100
Lie down. Lie down.

14:56.340 --> 14:57.340
You're really

14:57.939 --> 14:59.500
driving me crazy.

15:18.280 --> 15:19.040
Who is it?

15:23.239 --> 15:24.359
Feng Lin?

15:24.719 --> 15:25.599
What brings you here?

15:25.960 --> 15:28.560
Fei Ni, I'm here on behalf
of the factory office for a home visit.

15:31.479 --> 15:32.560
Feng Lin,

15:33.551 --> 15:34.328
have some coffee.

15:38.800 --> 15:39.680
Fei Ni,

15:40.160 --> 15:42.119
if you've suffered any grievances,
just tell me.

15:42.160 --> 15:44.440
I'll report everything truthfully
to Vice Director Chen.

15:44.479 --> 15:45.879
All the female workers and I

15:45.879 --> 15:47.200
will stand up for you.

15:48.479 --> 15:49.599
Feng Lin,

15:50.440 --> 15:51.870
I haven't suffered any grievances.

15:53.599 --> 15:54.399
Fei Ni,

15:55.399 --> 15:57.080
a lot of people at the factory envy you.

15:57.080 --> 15:58.119
They say you married well.

15:58.684 --> 16:00.084
Now that I've seen your place,

16:00.320 --> 16:01.719
the house is quite spacious.

16:03.719 --> 16:05.479
But whether a woman is truly happy

16:05.590 --> 16:07.284
can't be judged by the size of her home.

16:08.160 --> 16:09.399
As the saying goes,

16:09.560 --> 16:11.960
only the feet know if the shoes fit.

16:12.479 --> 16:13.879
Some people swallow their pain

16:14.239 --> 16:15.800
out of pride.

16:16.560 --> 16:18.280
I'm here to give you a chance.

16:18.359 --> 16:19.519
You need to seize it.

16:19.617 --> 16:21.590
Otherwise, if you're bullied again
in the future,

16:21.599 --> 16:23.399
don't blame us for not helping you.

16:24.160 --> 16:25.119
Feng Lin,

16:25.119 --> 16:26.800
thank you for your concern.

16:26.999 --> 16:28.479
Fang Muyang and I

16:29.040 --> 16:30.399
have a very good relationship.

16:30.920 --> 16:32.239
If there's nothing else,

16:32.239 --> 16:33.160
I won't keep you.

16:33.160 --> 16:34.160
That won't do.

16:34.560 --> 16:36.280
I've come with a task.

16:36.280 --> 16:37.840
I must look into

16:37.840 --> 16:38.999
what happens in your family

16:39.106 --> 16:40.684
and announce it to the whole factory.

16:41.160 --> 16:42.119
Feng Lin,

16:42.119 --> 16:43.639
would you be especially happy

16:44.160 --> 16:45.479
if I weren't living well?

16:46.160 --> 16:47.359
What are you talking about?

16:47.680 --> 16:50.399
I'm here representing the factory
to care about the workers.

16:50.399 --> 16:52.080
You must explain

16:52.080 --> 16:53.960
what happened to the injury
on your neck.

16:53.960 --> 16:54.800
It's a mosquito bite.

16:54.800 --> 16:56.760
How big was the mosquito
that you needed a medicated patch for?

16:56.773 --> 16:57.995
Take it off and let me see.

17:06.800 --> 17:08.440
That's definitely not a mosquito bite.

17:08.599 --> 17:10.759
It was a one-meter-ninety mosquito.

17:16.599 --> 17:18.359
I'm not 1.9 meters tall.

17:18.920 --> 17:20.320
I'm at most 1.88.

17:20.599 --> 17:21.920
You're lying.

17:22.160 --> 17:23.639
I was rounding down.

17:23.680 --> 17:24.599
I'm really not 1.9.

17:24.599 --> 17:26.599
Look, when I hug you,

17:26.719 --> 17:28.479
your head reaches my chin.

17:28.599 --> 17:30.200
Look at the height of our noses.

17:30.200 --> 17:30.999
Our noses...

17:31.790 --> 17:33.080
are about the same height.

17:33.440 --> 17:34.359
How is that the same?

17:37.160 --> 17:39.280
What is this? Why is it so bitter?

17:40.960 --> 17:41.639
Feng Lin,

17:41.920 --> 17:43.359
even if you don't like coffee,

17:43.359 --> 17:45.040
you can't spill it on the sofa cover.

17:45.080 --> 17:46.320
It's just a piece of cloth.

17:46.399 --> 17:47.320
I'll compensate you.

17:48.399 --> 17:49.560
A piece of cloth?

17:49.680 --> 17:50.119
Fine.

17:50.719 --> 17:51.519
Pay for it then.

17:52.200 --> 17:53.519
Give me

17:53.519 --> 17:54.399
40 yuan.

17:55.840 --> 17:56.359
Come on.

17:57.320 --> 17:58.399
40?

17:58.630 --> 18:00.262
Fang Muyang, are you trying to scam me?

18:00.399 --> 18:01.160
Feng Lin,

18:01.639 --> 18:03.200
it's not about the money.

18:03.560 --> 18:04.800
This sofa cover

18:05.200 --> 18:06.960
is entirely hand-crocheted.

18:07.359 --> 18:08.719
My mom's students made it together

18:08.719 --> 18:09.759
for her back then.

18:09.960 --> 18:11.320
And it's a complete set.

18:11.340 --> 18:13.640
If one piece is stained,
how can we use the set properly?

18:13.800 --> 18:15.617
How am I supposed
to explain it to my mom?

18:17.840 --> 18:18.479
But I...

18:19.960 --> 18:21.200
I don't have that much money.

18:22.920 --> 18:24.399
If you don't have the money,

18:25.519 --> 18:26.960
write a letter of apology.

18:29.680 --> 18:30.479
Alright.

18:31.719 --> 18:32.999
I'll write it.

18:34.320 --> 18:35.879
I have some requirements

18:36.479 --> 18:37.560
for the letter.

18:39.399 --> 18:40.160
It must be

18:40.519 --> 18:41.840
sincere,

18:42.399 --> 18:43.479
beautifully written,

18:43.639 --> 18:44.560
and most importantly,

18:44.999 --> 18:47.200
you must use the word "clarity".

18:47.599 --> 18:49.080
There can't be any errors.

18:54.999 --> 18:55.680
Fine.

18:56.719 --> 18:57.519
I'll write it.

19:02.599 --> 19:03.800
Off you go.

19:28.680 --> 19:29.799
Your body won't be able to

19:29.920 --> 19:31.120
handle that much tea.

19:31.239 --> 19:32.120
I can handle it.

19:32.719 --> 19:34.239
I have to correct all the calculations

19:34.239 --> 19:35.079
as soon as possible.

19:35.537 --> 19:37.204
Otherwise, it'll affect the schedule.

19:41.010 --> 19:43.826
Pushing yourself like this will
make you more likely to make mistakes.

19:44.079 --> 19:44.799
I won't.

19:46.239 --> 19:48.440
I never make the same mistake twice.

20:16.719 --> 20:17.239
Coming.

20:22.120 --> 20:22.920
Qu Hua?

20:24.920 --> 20:25.440
Dad,

20:26.079 --> 20:27.600
I'd like to talk with you and Mom.

20:30.600 --> 20:31.519
Come on in.

20:31.799 --> 20:32.319
Come.

20:40.279 --> 20:41.920
Did Fang Mujing send you?

20:42.479 --> 20:43.120
No.

20:44.200 --> 20:45.400
There are some things

20:45.626 --> 20:46.880
I wanted to talk to you about.

20:48.479 --> 20:49.519
Do you know

20:50.680 --> 20:52.519
why Fang Mujing married me
in the first place?

20:56.039 --> 20:57.319
It was because of her background.

20:58.319 --> 20:59.479
She had no way to pursue

20:59.640 --> 21:00.799
the career she loved.

21:01.120 --> 21:01.960
So

21:02.600 --> 21:03.680
even though she knew

21:04.239 --> 21:05.559
I only saw her

21:05.880 --> 21:07.648
as a substitute for my late girlfriend,

21:08.079 --> 21:09.880
she still married me without hesitation.

21:10.400 --> 21:11.600
At that time,

21:12.640 --> 21:13.719
she wasn't marrying me.

21:15.840 --> 21:17.079
She was marrying her career.

21:19.519 --> 21:20.079
Dad.

21:20.880 --> 21:21.400
Mom.

21:21.799 --> 21:23.885
I know you feel this is unfair.

21:24.479 --> 21:25.640
I wouldn't dare say

21:25.640 --> 21:27.493
I can completely understand
how you feel.

21:27.680 --> 21:29.200
That's why I came today

21:29.200 --> 21:30.640
to tell you

21:31.079 --> 21:33.079
what kind of person
I know Fang Mujing to be.

21:34.279 --> 21:36.120
The first time I met her

21:36.559 --> 21:37.519
was on a train.

21:38.239 --> 21:39.120
Back then,

21:40.079 --> 21:41.920
she had cut ties with you.

21:42.360 --> 21:43.600
But she still

21:44.293 --> 21:45.648
secretly kept the family photo

21:46.093 --> 21:47.470
tucked inside her math textbook.

21:48.239 --> 21:48.880
Later,

21:49.270 --> 21:50.260
I started to think about

21:50.440 --> 21:51.680
marrying her.

21:51.840 --> 21:53.248
But I still had some reservations

21:53.315 --> 21:54.382
about her background.

21:54.519 --> 21:55.680
So I asked her

21:56.400 --> 21:58.519
whether she had completely
cut ties with you.

22:01.319 --> 22:02.160
Do you know

22:03.239 --> 22:04.680
what she said?

22:05.519 --> 22:06.600
My father's surname is Fang.

22:06.737 --> 22:07.880
My mother's surname is Mu.

22:09.079 --> 22:10.479
That's how I got my name.

22:11.319 --> 22:13.079
How could I possibly draw a line
between us?

22:14.715 --> 22:16.471
My parents may have made mistakes,

22:16.719 --> 22:18.519
but they never did wrong by me.

22:19.840 --> 22:21.039
Father's surname is Fang.

22:22.680 --> 22:23.920
Mother's surname is Mu.

22:24.382 --> 22:25.804
How much risk did Mujing take

22:26.719 --> 22:30.079
to say something like that?

22:30.880 --> 22:31.400
Mom,

22:31.999 --> 22:33.039
you may not know.

22:35.039 --> 22:36.079
That in her heart,

22:36.719 --> 22:38.680
you've always been the goal
she strives for.

22:39.239 --> 22:39.920
Although

22:40.319 --> 22:41.719
she doesn't talk about you often,

22:42.200 --> 22:43.239
whenever she mentions

22:43.600 --> 22:45.039
your past achievements,

22:45.319 --> 22:47.079
she can't hide the pride in her voice.

22:48.440 --> 22:48.960
Mom,

22:49.719 --> 22:50.920
you always taught her

22:51.382 --> 22:53.160
that no matter
what difficulties she faces,

22:53.160 --> 22:54.880
she must pursue her own career.

22:56.319 --> 22:57.640
She's done that now.

22:58.519 --> 23:00.120
But you've shut her out.

23:01.640 --> 23:03.079
I don't think that's fair.

23:22.799 --> 23:23.880
This photo.

23:24.590 --> 23:26.360
She tore it,
and then taped it back together.

23:27.079 --> 23:28.840
She tore it
so no one else would find it.

23:29.799 --> 23:30.680
And taping it back

23:30.848 --> 23:33.137
was because she feared
she might never see it again.

23:41.519 --> 23:42.440
Let me ask you.

23:44.410 --> 23:46.217
Do you love Fang Mujing?

23:47.400 --> 23:48.510
Not treating her

23:48.600 --> 23:49.880
as someone else,

23:51.039 --> 23:52.079
but loving her.

23:55.319 --> 23:55.920
Yes.

23:59.120 --> 24:00.999
We've taken many wrong turns.

24:02.400 --> 24:03.719
But I'm certain

24:05.680 --> 24:06.880
that we truly love each other.

24:10.319 --> 24:12.840
If one day, Fang Mujing,
for the sake of her career,

24:14.680 --> 24:15.799
had to sacrifice you,

24:16.719 --> 24:17.759
would it hurt?

24:24.319 --> 24:25.079
It would.

24:27.479 --> 24:28.640
But after the pain,

24:29.200 --> 24:30.239
I would still support her.

25:09.079 --> 25:09.999
Ms. Mu.

25:13.600 --> 25:14.799
There's something

25:15.279 --> 25:16.440
I need to return to you.

25:29.079 --> 25:29.999
Remember this.

25:31.600 --> 25:32.519
Next time,

25:32.999 --> 25:34.079
if you tear it,

25:35.680 --> 25:37.160
don't tear yourself apart.

25:49.920 --> 25:51.440
If I don't tear myself apart,

25:53.400 --> 25:54.880
then I might tear you apart.

26:00.239 --> 26:02.799
Some things were cleared out from home.

26:05.999 --> 26:07.200
This is yours, right?

26:14.039 --> 26:14.719
(Mom.)

26:15.479 --> 26:16.680
I got two perfect scores.

26:17.079 --> 26:17.880
Really?

26:18.026 --> 26:19.493
(Fang Mujing: 100)
That's wonderful.

26:21.120 --> 26:22.319
What reward do you want?

26:22.600 --> 26:23.920
I want that mirror of yours.

26:25.920 --> 26:26.319
Here.

26:26.400 --> 26:27.448
It's yours as a reward.

26:27.920 --> 26:28.640
Thank you, Mom.

26:28.640 --> 26:29.640
I'll keep working hard.

26:46.600 --> 26:47.248
Mom.

26:58.400 --> 26:59.200
Alright.

26:59.319 --> 27:00.160
Don't cry.

27:03.804 --> 27:04.790
Okay, no more tears.

27:48.448 --> 27:49.537
Alright, come on.

27:50.835 --> 27:51.996
Everyone, look forward.

27:53.010 --> 27:53.570
Smile.

27:54.719 --> 27:55.519
One.

27:55.880 --> 27:56.479
Two.

27:56.830 --> 27:57.648
Three.

28:05.640 --> 28:06.519
What a great photo.

28:07.600 --> 28:08.880
You looked lovely as a child.

28:09.640 --> 28:10.640
And even more now.

28:19.920 --> 28:21.440
Thank you, Qu Hua.

28:34.400 --> 28:35.319
Break up?

28:36.799 --> 28:38.120
Wang Defa, what do you mean?

28:38.759 --> 28:39.960
Exactly what it sounds like.

28:40.680 --> 28:42.079
I think the two of us

28:42.200 --> 28:44.048
shouldn't stay
in a relationship right now.

28:44.200 --> 28:45.719
What do you mean?

28:46.160 --> 28:46.880
Have you forgotten

28:46.880 --> 28:48.319
how you pursued me back then?

28:49.519 --> 28:51.360
I did like you back then.

28:51.960 --> 28:53.200
But things are different now.

28:54.600 --> 28:55.999
What's different?

29:03.960 --> 29:05.960
Because I was assigned
to the workshop now?

29:07.200 --> 29:07.640
Yes.

29:08.560 --> 29:09.920
Because you work in the workshop.

29:10.204 --> 29:11.360
Before I went to college,

29:11.360 --> 29:12.519
who was I seeing?

29:12.880 --> 29:14.120
Someone from the factory office.

29:14.999 --> 29:16.400
And after college?

29:17.079 --> 29:18.519
Now I'm dating a workshop worker.

29:19.759 --> 29:21.200
Then what was the point of college?

29:26.360 --> 29:27.160
Wang Defa.

29:28.279 --> 29:29.360
Have you forgotten

29:30.360 --> 29:32.360
how you got into college?

29:32.360 --> 29:34.672
Who recommended you for it?

29:35.799 --> 29:36.279
You did.

29:37.400 --> 29:39.160
But what did you promise me back then?

29:39.680 --> 29:40.920
You said once I graduated,

29:41.920 --> 29:43.719
you would get me
into the Publicity Division.

29:44.120 --> 29:45.160
But now?

29:45.360 --> 29:46.200
Forget about me.

29:46.460 --> 29:47.985
Can you even get in yourself?

29:50.435 --> 29:51.234
Feng Lin.

29:52.079 --> 29:52.920
Love is a choice.

29:53.680 --> 29:54.640
Breaking up is, too.

29:55.920 --> 29:56.960
Let's part on good terms.

29:58.204 --> 29:59.804
Don't come looking for me again.

30:06.072 --> 30:07.035
Wang Defa!

30:49.435 --> 30:50.316
What are you doing?

30:52.680 --> 30:53.472
I just

30:54.648 --> 30:55.960
need to go to the hospital.

31:02.600 --> 31:03.360
Stew this.

31:31.120 --> 31:31.559
Aihong.

31:32.880 --> 31:33.400
Aihong.

31:37.999 --> 31:39.160
Fei Ting, you're here.

31:40.120 --> 31:41.719
I brought you some food.

31:42.559 --> 31:43.640
Thank you.

31:45.440 --> 31:46.319
Well...

31:48.160 --> 31:48.920
Lin Mei

31:49.680 --> 31:50.920
is still upset with us?

31:51.400 --> 31:52.680
The bone soup in here

31:52.880 --> 31:53.960
was her idea.

31:58.880 --> 31:59.719
Have a seat.

31:59.999 --> 32:01.279
Watch him finish this.

32:01.279 --> 32:02.239
I'll go get some water.

32:02.799 --> 32:03.319
Okay.

32:04.360 --> 32:05.479
Come on, sit.

32:15.799 --> 32:16.759
Time to eat, Song.

32:18.200 --> 32:18.999
I don't want any.

32:27.680 --> 32:28.160
Song.

32:29.200 --> 32:30.322
Don't worry too much.

32:31.920 --> 32:34.319
With your leg injured,
you can't drive anymore.

32:34.759 --> 32:36.400
But I thought it through on my way back.

32:36.715 --> 32:39.200
You could work as a block.
One side higher, one side lower.

32:39.200 --> 32:40.610
That way the leverage works better.

32:40.650 --> 32:42.360
Looks like fate is pointing you there.

32:43.848 --> 32:45.510
Is that even a decent thing to say?

32:45.799 --> 32:47.079
Of course it is.

32:47.279 --> 32:47.799
Song,

32:47.960 --> 32:49.319
I know quite a few chefs.

32:49.340 --> 32:50.519
If you really want to learn,

32:50.519 --> 32:51.799
I can introduce you.

32:53.680 --> 32:54.479
Fei Ting,

32:55.400 --> 32:56.319
let me tell you,

32:56.799 --> 32:58.799
there's no way in my life
I'd become a cook.

32:59.559 --> 33:01.960
Song, that's not being a cook.

33:02.479 --> 33:03.160
A prep cook.

33:03.582 --> 33:04.760
The one who chops vegetables.

33:05.693 --> 33:07.626
Not even qualified
to handle the cooking yet.

33:10.360 --> 33:11.440
Look at this knife work.

33:11.440 --> 33:12.400
So precise.

33:12.600 --> 33:13.937
If you're willing to learn,

33:13.960 --> 33:15.550
you could master a skill like this too.

33:20.160 --> 33:20.920
You...

33:22.680 --> 33:23.680
Fine, don't eat then.

33:23.790 --> 33:25.293
But you can't push yourself like this.

33:25.360 --> 33:26.550
Come on, lie down.

33:26.671 --> 33:28.004
You're still recovering.

33:31.519 --> 33:32.600
That's really well cut.

33:34.519 --> 33:35.519
If you don't want to eat,

33:35.640 --> 33:36.960
at least have some soup.

33:38.360 --> 33:40.160
Lin Mei asked for it to be made.

33:48.330 --> 33:49.937
(Decision on the Dismissal of Feng Lin's
Worker Status. Aug 26, 1977.)

33:49.980 --> 33:52.293
The machines are destroyed.
Feng Lin is being dismissed.

33:52.671 --> 33:54.920
The machines burned out.
They can't even be repaired.

33:54.920 --> 33:56.319
This is really serious.

33:56.960 --> 33:58.079
Oh...

34:02.600 --> 34:03.400
Ms. Liu,

34:03.920 --> 34:04.799
what happened?

34:05.559 --> 34:06.319
Feng Lin

34:06.840 --> 34:08.159
caused a production accident.

34:08.360 --> 34:09.360
I heard

34:09.360 --> 34:12.079
several machines
in the sizing workshop were burned out.

34:12.110 --> 34:13.204
They can't even be repaired.

34:13.937 --> 34:14.720
She was dismissed.

34:15.880 --> 34:16.559
Look.

34:19.035 --> 34:20.113
(Decision on the Dismissal of Feng Lin's
Worker Status. Aug 26, 1977)

34:20.114 --> 34:21.537
(Worker Feng Lin of the Sizing Workshop
violated operating procedures.)

34:21.538 --> 34:22.572
(Resulting in a major equipment accident
at the factory.)

34:25.199 --> 34:26.079
It's my fault.

34:26.190 --> 34:27.048
Vice Director Chen,

34:27.172 --> 34:28.453
please don't dismiss me.

34:29.400 --> 34:30.422
Do you realize

34:31.360 --> 34:32.999
that because of your mistake,

34:33.159 --> 34:35.440
two machines were seriously damaged?

34:35.840 --> 34:38.159
It caused heavy losses to our factory.

34:39.679 --> 34:41.320
With an attitude like yours,

34:41.440 --> 34:43.199
this cannot be tolerated.

34:43.559 --> 34:44.159
I'm sorry.

34:44.159 --> 34:44.960
Vice Director Chen.

34:46.320 --> 34:47.760
I promise there won't be a next time.

34:47.880 --> 34:49.720
You're not apologizing to me.

34:55.448 --> 34:56.560
The factory office

34:58.079 --> 35:00.079
has already issued the dismissal notice.

35:01.800 --> 35:02.639
Your housing

35:03.519 --> 35:04.519
has also been reclaimed.

35:26.079 --> 35:26.479
Fei Ni.

35:28.559 --> 35:29.360
Fang Muyang.

35:29.447 --> 35:30.519
(Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory)

35:30.519 --> 35:31.800
What's the rush?

35:32.519 --> 35:33.679
Our house is back.

35:34.559 --> 35:35.079
Really?

35:35.599 --> 35:37.440
Feng Lin caused a production accident

35:37.440 --> 35:38.400
and was dismissed.

35:38.599 --> 35:40.880
The factory decided
to return the house to us.

35:41.559 --> 35:42.360
Fang Muyang.

35:43.079 --> 35:44.199
We have a home now.

36:05.639 --> 36:07.119
You were living here just fine.

36:07.199 --> 36:08.840
Why should you move out?

36:10.199 --> 36:10.639
Dad.

36:11.280 --> 36:13.079
The factory housing has to be occupied.

36:13.315 --> 36:15.110
If no one lives there,
it'll be taken back.

36:15.199 --> 36:17.039
Then let them take it back.

36:17.240 --> 36:19.440
It's not like you two
have nowhere to live.

36:19.639 --> 36:20.639
That won't do.

36:20.639 --> 36:22.159
That's the home Fei Ni and I have.

36:22.999 --> 36:24.720
And this isn't your home?

36:24.800 --> 36:25.360
Dad.

36:26.199 --> 36:27.440
You won't let us move out.

36:27.599 --> 36:28.999
Is it because you'll miss us,

36:29.400 --> 36:30.440
or because without Fei Ni,

36:30.440 --> 36:31.960
no one will help sort your manuscripts?

36:31.960 --> 36:33.720
Don't talk nonsense.

36:34.199 --> 36:34.800
Fei Ni,

36:35.515 --> 36:37.110
if you don't want to move, then don't.

36:37.119 --> 36:38.119
Don't listen to him.

36:39.999 --> 36:40.800
Dad,

36:41.639 --> 36:44.639
I've truly been
very happy living here lately.

36:44.639 --> 36:46.519
I've treated this as my own home.

36:47.400 --> 36:48.119
But

36:48.720 --> 36:49.559
Fang Muyang and I

36:49.559 --> 36:51.920
really want a little home of our own.

36:53.760 --> 36:54.720
It's alright.

36:54.720 --> 36:55.559
If you miss us,

36:55.559 --> 36:56.360
we'll come visit.

36:56.519 --> 36:57.119
Alright?

36:58.920 --> 36:59.639
Fang,

37:01.199 --> 37:03.400
don't make things difficult for them.

37:03.400 --> 37:05.290
You can't insist they
stay and keep you company

37:05.310 --> 37:06.999
just because you're getting older.

37:06.999 --> 37:08.599
They have their own lives.

37:08.720 --> 37:10.119
Didn't you hear Fei Ni?

37:10.119 --> 37:11.320
They'll still come back.

37:13.760 --> 37:14.559
Exactly.

37:15.440 --> 37:17.400
Our Ms. Mu really has wisdom.

37:17.400 --> 37:18.320
Such a broad vision.

37:19.372 --> 37:20.772
What a flatterer.

37:22.260 --> 37:22.747
Dad,

37:23.559 --> 37:24.999
this is what I was thinking.

37:25.960 --> 37:28.599
Look, my sister and brother-in-law
still live in the hospital dorm.

37:28.840 --> 37:29.639
Once we move out,

37:29.639 --> 37:30.720
they can move back in.

37:30.920 --> 37:32.240
You'll still have company.

37:33.400 --> 37:34.639
Your brother-in-law agrees?

37:36.199 --> 37:37.400
Does your sister?

37:37.400 --> 37:38.280
Of course.

37:38.479 --> 37:39.920
I've already asked them.

37:39.920 --> 37:41.119
They're happy to do it.

37:41.360 --> 37:41.960
Really?

37:43.159 --> 37:44.320
Alright.

37:44.559 --> 37:45.559
This way,

37:45.559 --> 37:46.920
they can

37:46.920 --> 37:48.989
discuss research topics together.

37:48.990 --> 37:50.404
Discuss research topics with me?

37:50.426 --> 37:51.920
So they're not close with you anymore?

37:51.920 --> 37:53.400
Close, of course we are.

37:56.320 --> 37:57.800
What are you two standing there for?

37:57.800 --> 37:58.840
Start packing.

38:04.639 --> 38:06.720
My little treasure is back.

38:09.950 --> 38:14.115
(With the resolve of Yu Gong
who moved the mountains,)

38:14.115 --> 38:16.990
(no difficulty
is too great to overcome.)

38:16.999 --> 38:17.920
Chief Wang.

38:18.320 --> 38:18.920
Fang.

38:19.159 --> 38:19.599
Fei Ni.

38:20.039 --> 38:21.039
You're finally back.

38:21.039 --> 38:22.760
- We're back.
- Come. Let me help.

38:22.760 --> 38:23.760
- Careful.
- It's fine.

38:23.826 --> 38:24.990
What is this? A piano?

38:24.999 --> 38:25.519
Yes.

38:25.840 --> 38:26.720
My parents' piano.

38:26.720 --> 38:27.880
That's quite something.

38:27.880 --> 38:28.240
Come on.

38:28.240 --> 38:28.840
Easy.

38:28.840 --> 38:29.400
Careful.

38:30.079 --> 38:30.840
Come on.

38:30.840 --> 38:31.800
Fei Ni has moved back.

38:31.800 --> 38:33.960
(Follow the Communist Party)
Come help. Stop playing. Come on.

38:39.880 --> 38:40.559
Look at this.

38:42.639 --> 38:43.840
Parents are so generous.

38:43.840 --> 38:45.840
They gave us such a nice piano.

38:46.199 --> 38:47.479
My parents can't play anyway.

38:47.999 --> 38:49.400
Giving it to you

38:49.400 --> 38:50.639
is putting it to good use.

38:51.400 --> 38:52.240
Then,

38:53.440 --> 38:54.840
let me show you what I can do.

38:57.920 --> 38:58.800
Comrade Fei Ni,

38:59.199 --> 38:59.679
please.

39:18.960 --> 39:21.070
- Who's playing the piano?
- It sounds wonderful.

39:21.079 --> 39:21.880
It really does.

39:22.479 --> 39:22.920
Yes.

39:23.360 --> 39:24.840
It must be Fei Ni's place.

39:57.610 --> 40:02.172
(Inpatient Department)

41:04.039 --> 41:04.999
Aihong

41:05.119 --> 41:06.039
is off to work?

41:13.479 --> 41:14.079
Try some.

41:26.760 --> 41:27.280
Song,

41:29.026 --> 41:30.190
you've been here ten days.

41:30.920 --> 41:32.315
It's about time to be discharged.

41:33.320 --> 41:35.039
You need to think about the future.

41:35.999 --> 41:36.800
I know

41:37.280 --> 41:38.559
you don't want to be a prep cook,

41:39.199 --> 41:40.599
and you look down on being a chef.

41:42.159 --> 41:42.960
But think about it.

41:44.440 --> 41:45.280
When you go home,

41:46.400 --> 41:48.280
you can cook a meal
for your wife and child.

41:49.559 --> 41:51.159
Watching them eat their fill,

41:51.960 --> 41:52.720
and enjoying it.

41:54.159 --> 41:55.840
That's a real kind of happiness.

42:00.226 --> 42:01.320
I've got something to do.

42:01.840 --> 42:02.519
I'm heading out.

42:04.360 --> 42:05.840
Lin Mei made these wontons.

43:28.860 --> 43:33.340
♪After the laughter, I think of you♪

43:35.900 --> 43:40.620
♪After the storm, I think of you♪

43:43.140 --> 43:49.260
♪In the little courtyard,
there you are dancing♪

43:50.260 --> 43:54.820
♪That earnest you,
smiling so innocently♪

43:57.300 --> 44:02.060
♪In spring, I stay by your side♪

44:04.500 --> 44:08.860
♪When summer comes, I watch over you♪

44:11.220 --> 44:17.860
♪In the light of dawn, you belong to me♪

44:17.860 --> 44:27.460
♪At the edge of the world,
I will still hold you tight♪

44:28.540 --> 44:34.700
♪There is a small place♪

44:34.700 --> 44:41.500
♪Where they carry big dreams♪

44:41.500 --> 44:48.860
♪Every lovely face♪

44:49.740 --> 44:55.900
♪Shines brightly in the heart♪

44:56.700 --> 45:02.740
♪Even when we collide,
we hold our course♪

45:03.940 --> 45:09.740
♪Even when we stumble,
we keep our resolve♪

45:10.820 --> 45:17.100
♪My you, walking toward the distance♪

45:17.900 --> 45:26.140
♪Please carry our dreams
and let them soar♪
